</ul><p id="p17">This year’s App Store Awards finalists showcase just how much depth and breadth there is on the App Store. Apple has come up with an excellent list of finalists, which includes many MacStories favorites, like Paste, (Not Boring) Camera, Things, Ulysses, Pocket Casts, Big Walk, BALL x PIT, and many others you should check out.</p>
<p id="p18">Soon, we’ll hear who won each category, but I appreciate that Apple publishes the list of finalists because any of these apps would be a great pick as the winner of its category. Congratulations to all the finalists. It’s quite an honor to be recognized as one of the best among the millions of apps and games on the App Store, and it’s great to see the hard work that went into each of these apps recognized.</p>
